---
// HowItWorks.astro
---

<section id="funcionamiento" class="py-32 bg-slate-900 relative overflow-hidden border-t border-slate-800/50">
  
  <!-- Resplandores de fondo para profundidad volumétrica -->
  <div class="absolute top-1/2 left-0 -translate-y-1/2 -translate-x-1/3 w-[800px] h-[800px] bg-teal-900/20 rounded-full blur-[150px] pointer-events-none -z-10"></div>
  <div class="absolute bottom-0 right-0 translate-x-1/4 translate-y-1/4 w-[600px] h-[600px] bg-emerald-900/20 rounded-full blur-[120px] pointer-events-none -z-10"></div>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
    
    <div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-center gap-20">
      
      <!-- Columna Izquierda: Copywriting y Pasos -->
      <div class="lg:w-1/2">
        <div class="mb-12">
          <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 py-1 px-3 rounded-full bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 text-teal-400 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-6 shadow-sm">
            <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 animate-pulse"></span>
            Despliegue Ágil
          </span>
          <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold text-white mb-6 leading-tight">
            Ingeniería diseñada para <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-teal-400 to-emerald-400">crecer contigo</span>
          </h2>
          <p class="text-slate-400 text-lg leading-relaxed">
            Olvida las instalaciones locales y los servidores físicos. Nuestro ecosistema opera 100% en la nube, permitiéndote encender o apagar módulos según el volumen de transacciones de tu operación.
          </p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="space-y-6">
          <!-- Paso 1 -->
          <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-slate-800/30 border border-slate-700/50 hover:bg-slate-800/80 hover:border-teal-500/30 transition-all duration-300 group">
            <div class="flex gap-5">
              <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-slate-900 border border-slate-700 text-teal-500 flex items-center justify-center font-black text-xl group-hover:bg-teal-500 group-hover:text-slate-900 group-hover:border-teal-400 transition-colors shadow-inner">
                1
              </div>
              <div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2 group-hover:text-teal-400 transition-colors">Implementación Inmediata</h3>
                <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Configuramos tu base de datos y levantamos tu instancia en minutos. Entras, te logueas y empiezas a operar en tiempo récord.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          
          <!-- Paso 2 -->
          <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-slate-800/30 border border-slate-700/50 hover:bg-slate-800/80 hover:border-teal-500/30 transition-all duration-300 group">
            <div class="flex gap-5">
              <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-slate-900 border border-slate-700 text-teal-500 flex items-center justify-center font-black text-xl group-hover:bg-teal-500 group-hover:text-slate-900 group-hover:border-teal-400 transition-colors shadow-inner">
                2
              </div>
              <div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2 group-hover:text-teal-400 transition-colors">Planes Modulares</h3>
                <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">¿Necesitas control de inventario avanzado o facturación masiva? Activa los módulos exactos que tu empresa requiere sin pagar excedentes.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Paso 3 -->
          <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-slate-800/30 border border-slate-700/50 hover:bg-slate-800/80 hover:border-teal-500/30 transition-all duration-300 group">
            <div class="flex gap-5">
              <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-slate-900 border border-slate-700 text-teal-500 flex items-center justify-center font-black text-xl group-hover:bg-teal-500 group-hover:text-slate-900 group-hover:border-teal-400 transition-colors shadow-inner">
                3
              </div>
              <div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2 group-hover:text-teal-400 transition-colors">Operación y Respaldo</h3>
                <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Respaldos de información automáticos, actualizaciones de sistema transparentes y capacitación continua para tu equipo de trabajo.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Columna Derecha: Composición Visual (UI Flotante) -->
      <div class="lg:w-1/2 relative">
        <!-- Glow base -->
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-tr from-teal-500/20 to-emerald-500/20 rounded-[2.5rem] blur-3xl opacity-50"></div>
        
        <!-- Dashboard Principal (Cristal) -->
        <div class="relative bg-slate-800/60 backdrop-blur-2xl rounded-[2rem] border border-slate-600/50 shadow-2xl p-2 transform transition-transform hover:-translate-y-2 duration-700">
          
          <div class="bg-slate-900 rounded-[1.5rem] overflow-hidden border border-slate-700">
            <!-- Barra superior macOS Dark -->
            <div class="h-10 bg-slate-800/80 border-b border-slate-700 flex items-center px-4 gap-2">
              <div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-slate-600"></div>
              <div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-slate-600"></div>
              <div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-slate-600"></div>
            </div>
            
            <!-- Interior del Dashboard (Placeholder) -->
            <div class="aspect-[4/3] bg-[linear-gradient(to_right,#ffffff05_1px,transparent_1px),linear-gradient(to_bottom,#ffffff05_1px,transparent_1px)] bg-[size:20px_20px] flex flex-col items-center justify-center p-8 text-center relative">
              <div class="w-20 h-20 bg-slate-800 rounded-2xl border border-slate-700 flex items-center justify-center mb-6 shadow-lg">
                <svg class="w-10 h-10 text-teal-500" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M4 7v10c0 2.21 3.582 4 8 4s8-1.79 8-4V7M4 7c0 2.21 3.582 4 8 4s8-1.79 8-4M4 7c0-2.21 3.582-4 8-4s8 1.79 8 4m0 5c0 2.21-3.582 4-8 4s-8-1.79-8-4" />
                </svg>
              </div>
              <h4 class="text-white font-bold text-xl mb-2">Base de Datos Conectada</h4>
              <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm max-w-[280px]">Aquí puedes subir una captura de pantalla de los módulos de reportes y métricas de tus sistemas.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          
          <!-- Elemento flotante decorativo 1 -->
          <div class="absolute -right-8 top-12 bg-slate-800/80 backdrop-blur-xl border border-slate-600 rounded-2xl p-4 shadow-xl shadow-slate-900/50 animate-[bounce_4s_infinite]">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-teal-500/20 flex items-center justify-center text-teal-400">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <p class="text-white text-sm font-bold">Módulo Activo</p>
                <p class="text-teal-400 text-xs">Latencia: 12ms</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Elemento flotante decorativo 2 -->
          <div class="absolute -left-8 bottom-12 bg-slate-800/80 backdrop-blur-xl border border-slate-600 rounded-2xl p-4 shadow-xl shadow-slate-900/50 animate-[bounce_5s_infinite_reverse]">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/20 flex items-center justify-center text-emerald-400">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"/></svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <p class="text-white text-sm font-bold">Tráfico Seguro</p>
                <p class="text-slate-400 text-xs">Cifrado SSL</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>